      "message": "Could you take `transitiveOwner` out of the packagingspec? providers aren\u0027t supposed to be modified, which I don\u0027t think you\u0027re doing because you\u0027re copying `ps`, but it\u0027s confusing that that copy happens, and also that `transitivieOwner` exists in `PackagingSpec` but is never set to a value.\n\nA naive translation would be to make a local `map[PackagingSpec]string` for the transitive owners.",
