      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T19:12:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have updated the implementation to not use `transitiveOwner`.\n\nI think `map[PackagingSpec]string` might not handle cases where there are dup dependency paths\n```\ncc_binary {name: \"binfoo\", shared_libs: [\"libfoo\"]}\ncc_binary {name: \"binfoo_other\", shared_libs: [\"libfoo\"]}\n```\n\nif `binfoo` gets overriden, but `binfoo_other` does not, we would still need to install `libfoo`.\n\nTo handle cases like this, I have added a new `depNames` array.",
      "parentUuid": "751c78dc_e41387cc",
